  "sourceNotes": [
    "Alignment Scrying requires actual evidenced strong-alignment location; source rank5/10RP/60ft instantaneous sample does not establish unlimited remote reach or creature alignment roster.",
    "Commune preserves3 meaningful questions to independently eligible actual respondent; deity/powerful entity/knowledge/cooperation are separate predicates. No imported yes/no-only answer model, omniscient response or automatic Hunt from casting.",
    "Planar Binding Minor is distinct Divination6/13RP actual CR<=8 extraplanar target, preserving existing body/resources/creator/deadlines rather than creating a fresh companion.",
    "Lesser is Divination5/10RP one Celestial,Elemental or Outsider CR<=5; Greater is Divination7/17RP two independently eligible extraplanar allies CR<=8 each. New profiles/ratings require explicit review; no class-level/rank/HP-to-CR inference or replacement of Outsider with Fiend.",
    "Soul Cage preserves Enchantment dying-creature versus Necromancy dying-humanoid access; Crimson Agent route is actual Enchantment minimum19, Wizard11 Enchantment and Cleric11/Druid11 Necromancy. An unrelated feat grants no source timing.",
    "Soul Cage Action/paid Ready release follows whole real trigger event; Stable/Dead/replaced-death are not an interim Dying capture opportunity. Preserve actual custody and finite new use menu without resurrection, cloned identity, source refunds or invented ontology.",
    "Later exact applied LifeMatter5/Disintegrate and current accepted dependencies supersede historical pending labels only within actual scopes."
